<title>HUNGARY: HORIZON POSTS '96 HUF90.5MLN PRE-TAX LOSS.</title>
<headline>HORIZON POSTS '96 HUF90.5MLN PRE-TAX LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>							 1996</p>
<p>    Operating result				92.2 loss</p>
<p>    Pre-tax result				  90.5 loss</p>
<p>    Net sales					111.9</p>
<p>     Domestic sales				 96.7</p>
<p>     Foreign sales				  15.2</p>
<p>    Other revenue				    7.6</p>
<p>    Material expenditures			 58.7</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditure			 39.4</p>
<p>    Depreciation				    11.9</p>
<p>    Other costs				    113.2</p>
<p>    Other expenditures			     9.9</p>
<p>    Financial result				 1.7 loss</p>
<p>NOTE: The figures are non-consolidated and were calculated</p>
<p>according to the Hungarian accounting standard. Comparative</p>
<p>1995 figures were not immediately available. Horizon-Multiplan</p>
<p>Rt is a research and development company.</p>
<p>-- Sandor Peto, Budapest newsroom (36 10 327 4040</p>
